{"parentUuid": null, "isSidechain": false, "type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": "上界强者能不能下界，我想好了：每个界都有一个承载上限，沉壤最多撑到化形后期，浮屿最多踏虚初期，星阙不设限。从上面下来的人，不管原本多高，一进来就被天衡压到这个界的上限，正好卡在那儿。这样岑舟去沉壤也只是化形后期，跟当地的顶尖高手、还有同样从上面下来的人在一个档位上，真动起手来有得打。"}, "uuid": "1618a091-3bc1-59cb-b7c7-f92a008f292c", "timestamp": "2026-10-14T01:03:00.000Z", "userType": "external", "cwd": "{{WT}}", "sessionId": "aabd1662-c1c3-53d4-b9b1-3dfa34a3e6c7", "version": "2.1.215", "gitBranch": "HEAD"}
{"parentUuid": "1618a091-3bc1-59cb-b7c7-f92a008f292c", "isSidechain": false, "type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_synth_8a765544ff8903986a63", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "这样定比「上界强者不许下界」好，因为它不是禁令，是一块**天花板**：每一界能装下的修为有个顶，谁来都一样。\n\n它带来的东西：\n\n1. **岑舟下界仍然强，但不再无解**：在沉壤她和别人一样卡在化形后期，输赢看经验和手段，不再看修为差。\n2. **和天衡「像一杆秤」对上了**：不是有谁在管，而是这杆秤只称得动这么多。\n3. **每一界的气质不同**：星阙不设限，最高的人只有在那里才是真正的最高；越往下，大家越被拉平。\n\n有一处要你定：**被压下去的修为去哪了？** 我先按「不消失，离开该界就恢复」记成 `[提议]`。\n\n先把上限记进 BIBLE："}], "stop_reason": "tool_use", "stop_sequence": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 0}}, "uuid": "f56d43a7-e95c-5668-b091-13612f14b807", "timestamp": "2026-10-14T01:03:20.000Z", "userType": "external", "cwd": "{{WT}}", "sessionId": "aabd1662-c1c3-53d4-b9b1-3dfa34a3e6c7", "version": "2.1.215", "gitBranch": "HEAD"}
{"parentUuid": "f56d43a7-e95c-5668-b091-13612f14b807", "isSidechain": false, "type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_synth_8a765544ff8903986a63", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_synth_03d7e169e2c5867d1673", "name": "Edit", "input": {"file_path": "{{WTF}}/business/Lab/Ember/docs/BIBLE.md", "old_string": "### 3.2 承载与压制\n- `[待定]` 上界强者下界有没有限制\n", "new_string": "### 3.2 承载与压制\n- `[定]` 每一界有承载上限：沉壤最高化形后期，浮屿最高踏虚初期，星阙不设限。\n  上界修士进入下界，修为被天衡压到该界的上限，正好卡在上限，不多不少\n- `[提议]` 被压下去的修为不会消失，离开该界即恢复\n"}}], "stop_reason": "tool_use", "stop_sequence": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 0}}, "uuid": "d4043b12-fbf4-5b72-a2a2-1dc625295825", "timestamp": "2026-10-14T01:03:40.000Z", "userType": "external", "cwd": "{{WT}}", "sessionId": "aabd1662-c1c3-53d4-b9b1-3dfa34a3e6c7", "version": "2.1.215", "gitBranch": "HEAD"}
{"parentUuid": "d4043b12-fbf4-5b72-a2a2-1dc625295825", "isSidechain": false, "type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_synth_03d7e169e2c5867d1673", "type": "tool_result", "content": "The file {{WTF}}/business/Lab/Ember/docs/BIBLE.md has been updated successfully.", "is_error": false}]}, "uuid": "eb91bb60-3e84-528c-a80e-96a745be2fb6", "timestamp": "2026-10-14T01:04:00.000Z", "userType": "external", "cwd": "{{WT}}", "sessionId": "aabd1662-c1c3-53d4-b9b1-3dfa34a3e6c7", "version": "2.1.215", "gitBranch": "HEAD", "sourceToolAssistantUUID": "d4043b12-fbf4-5b72-a2a2-1dc625295825"}
{"parentUuid": "eb91bb60-3e84-528c-a80e-96a745be2fb6", "isSidechain": false, "type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_synth_03d7e169e2c5867d1673", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "记好了：承载上限标成 `[定]`，修为恢复那条先标 `[提议]`。"}], "stop_reason": "end_turn", "stop_sequence": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 0}}, "uuid": "91e2c490-fecf-52a5-9a77-3e0ac7d9ace5", "timestamp": "2026-10-14T01:04:20.000Z", "userType": "external", "cwd": "{{WT}}", "sessionId": "aabd1662-c1c3-53d4-b9b1-3dfa34a3e6c7", "version": "2.1.215", "gitBranch": "HEAD"}
{"parentUuid": "91e2c490-fecf-52a5-9a77-3e0ac7d9ace5", "isSidechain": false, "type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": "对，出了这个界就回来。再加一条：招式也有上限。一招打出去的力量要是超过这个界能承的量，周围空中会先冒出冰裂一样的纹路提醒；还硬要打，整个界就塌了，里面的人一个都跑不掉。所以岑舟在下界出手得收着，大招基本用不了。"}, "uuid": "52634f1f-d02c-5d19-9831-8fbf18512a9d", "timestamp": "2026-10-14T01:04:40.000Z", "userType": "external", "cwd": "{{WT}}", "sessionId": "aabd1662-c1c3-53d4-b9b1-3dfa34a3e6c7", "version": "2.1.215", "gitBranch": "HEAD"}
{"parentUuid": "52634f1f-d02c-5d19-9831-8fbf18512a9d", "isSidechain": false, "type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_synth_53821bdbd51e5baf0b7e", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "这样就有了两道上限，管的是不同的东西：\n\n| 上限 | 管什么 | 超出会怎样 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 承载上限 | 你在这一界**能是**多强 | 进门就被天衡压下去 |\n| 单招上限 | 你在这一界**能打出**多重的一招 | 先出界纹，再强行就整界崩塌 |\n\n**它能长出来的东西**\n\n1. **界纹是看得见的读数**：读者看到纹路就知道快到边了，不用报数值。\n2. **打斗变成收着打**：真正的高手比的是在界纹前停得住，这和岑舟「先算代价」的性子正好对上。\n3. **崩塌的分量够重**：整界陪葬，越线本身就是一场大戏。\n\n两个细节我先记成 `[提议]` / `[待定]`：\n- 界纹出现到崩塌之间留多久？我建议约十息，给收手或抢断留余地。\n- 崩塌之后那片界会怎样？我倾向变成没有灵气的死地。"}], "stop_reason": "tool_use", "stop_sequence": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 0}}, "uuid": "9048034a-eb00-5ae4-a446-b7c0f2aca2b5", "timestamp": "2026-10-14T01:05:00.000Z", "userType": "external", "cwd": "{{WT}}", "sessionId": "aabd1662-c1c3-53d4-b9b1-3dfa34a3e6c7", "version": "2.1.215", "gitBranch": "HEAD"}
{"parentUuid": "9048034a-eb00-5ae4-a446-b7c0f2aca2b5", "isSidechain": false, "type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_synth_53821bdbd51e5baf0b7e", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_synth_5dd6f39f96023078d9de", "name": "Edit", "input": {"file_path": "{{WTF}}/business/Lab/Ember/docs/BIBLE.md", "old_string": "- `[提议]` 被压下去的修为不会消失，离开该界即恢复\n", "new_string": "- `[定]` 被压下去的修为不会消失，离开该界即恢复\n- `[定]` 单招上限：一招之力超过所在界的承载，四周空中先浮现冰裂般的「界纹」示警；\n  仍强行出手，整个界随之崩塌，界内无人能逃\n- `[提议]` 界纹出现到崩塌之间约有十息，给打斗留出收手或抢断的余地\n- `[提议]` 界纹人人看得见，是读者也看得懂的危险读数，不用报数值\n- `[待定]` 崩塌之后界的残骸会怎样（Claude 建议：化为没有灵气的死地）\n"}}], "stop_reason": "tool_use", "stop_sequence": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 0}}, "uuid": "f13b3d30-dab0-50aa-89f3-fb85347f2e39", "timestamp": "2026-10-14T01:05:20.000Z", "userType": "external", "cwd": "{{WT}}", "sessionId": "aabd1662-c1c3-53d4-b9b1-3dfa34a3e6c7", "version": "2.1.215", "gitBranch": "HEAD"}
