{"parentUuid": "48e2ccb8-d81c-51da-b6f6-c7cf28b974c0", "isSidechain": false, "type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_synth_5dd6f39f96023078d9de", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "BIBLE 更新了：修为恢复和单招上限标成 `[定]`，十息缓冲和界纹读数是 `[提议]`，残骸是 `[待定]`。\n\n要你拍板两件事：\n1. 界纹到崩塌之间**十息**的缓冲，你同意吗？\n2. 崩塌后的残骸变成死地可以吗，还是你另有想法？"}], "stop_reason": "end_turn", "stop_sequence": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 0}}, "uuid": "7b51bee4-79f2-595e-8977-e1c9ba370af1", "timestamp": "2026-10-14T01:06:00.000Z", "userType": "external", "cwd": "{{WT}}", "sessionId": "aabd1662-c1c3-53d4-b9b1-3dfa34a3e6c7", "version": "2.1.215", "gitBranch": "HEAD"}
